================================================================================
Indirect / transitive dependencies
================================================================================

A number of indirect dependencies are pulled in through the direct ones
above (visible via `go list -m all` against go.sum) and ship in the binary.
Their licenses are inspected per release via `go-licenses`. None require
binary-distribution attribution beyond what is already covered above; the
distribution-time license texts are in the local Go module cache at
`$(go env GOMODCACHE)/<module>@<version>/LICENSE`.

To regenerate this file with full transitive coverage:

    go install github.com/google/go-licenses@latest
    go-licenses report ./cmd/pinch/ \
      --template scripts/notice-template.tpl \
      > NOTICE

(Template is not yet committed; the manual list above is the source of
truth pre-1.0.)

